.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/1589ccad-9210-46b2-afd6-fec6fc4c3663/WorldUtilities_screenshot_5.jpg","https://content1.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/a438fc84-3abd-4d73-9ad9-224da4a034d7/WorldUtilities_screenshot_6.jpg","https://content1.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/6235cf7b-38b6-47b4-a4b7-5dfa70243903/WorldUtilities_screenshot_7.jpg","https://content1.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/f0e6bc4a-6559-487a-baa4-4622c491bc18/WorldUtilities_screenshot_8.jpg","https://content1.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/b32f0392-92e6-4366-a238-c32cca7aa0a6/WorldUtilities_screenshot_9.jpg"],"version":"1.1.10","changelog":"- Added the Quarry Pickaxe and Deep Digger Shovel! \r\n- A new Bridge Builder utility!\r\n- Player Vaults, Tanning Rack and Ocean Rider!\r\n- Carpet and Half Slabs can be placed on Portal Pads!\r\n- 10+ additional Controller configurations!\r\n- Over 22 additional QOL fixes and features!\r\n- New support Discord!","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-16T01:14:34.756Z","faqEntries":null,"howToTitle":"World Utilities Introduction ","howToEntries":[{"heading":"Read the Guide Book ","content":"When you first join your world with World Utilities installed, you will find a Guide Book in your inventory. It is important that you read this, as it tells you all the little details about each of the tools, utilities and items within the Add-On. "},{"heading":"Craft your items","content":"All items within World Utilities are craftable. The recipes can be located by clicking or searching for the item within a Crafting Table, but they can also be found within the Guide Book. If you lose the Guide Book, don’t worry; you can craft another. "},{"heading":"Use the Controller","content":"We added a Controller item to the game that can be used to change many of the settings in the Add-On. This includes enabling or disabling each individual item from working within your world, as well as making smaller changes to each item, such as durability, speed, powers and much more."},{"heading":"Have fun","content":"Now that you have read all about the Add-On, crafted your items and used the Controller to adjust the Add-On settings to exactly how you want them to be, it is time to adventure off into your world. Good luck exploring out there! "}],"tags":["cd927ddf-5334-4b9a-8be4-b2cd0c57004f","c1240a22-2a7a-4ad2-a1a3-a03d99355265","7192c893-ba33-4f79-8e22-66203c64b5e0","tag.add_on","tag.craftable_tools","tag.custom_tools","tag.farming","tag.utilities","tag.mining","major","3P","addon","genre.survival","realms_plus","csb"],"contentSize":1611017.0,"downloadUrls":["https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/6b686f43-eaeb-43e7-83f0-c1f9a24c8823/primary.zip"],"downloadVariants":[{"label":"Standard","tags":[],"urls":["https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/6b686f43-eaeb-43e7-83f0-c1f9a24c8823/primary.zip"]}],"cdnUrls":["https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/6b686f43-eaeb-43e7-83f0-c1f9a24c8823/primary.zip"],"legacyUrls":[],"downloadable":true}}